The main tradeoff here is Sting early or Sting late.
Since a chaotic character can get Sting as a gift and
it comes fireproof that way it's a good option.  But any
character who can get to Expert in dagger gets enough
benefit from exercising dagger class that is is worth
wielding an artifact dagger earlier in the game than the
first possible altar camping.  So for non-chaotics who
can't get to expert in dagger waiting until very late in
the game is the way to go on naming these two.  No
requirements other than mulling over the timing.

